Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek freedom, and it will lie\Nstretched out before your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Karaoke
