Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless,\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way from the moon sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over streets of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless,\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some days somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight. I will search for everywhere?.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.00,0:02:12.63,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H262222&\3c&H171717&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(899,0)\t(854,899,\1a&H00&)}Heaven's Gate
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.00,0:02:12.63,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(899,0)\c&HF8F8F9&}Heaven's Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What they got is lucky! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna sit\Nhere and let him escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just lost 160 million Barry\NBounty, and you're laughing about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, Burgess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.03,0:02:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't left this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet them soon enough, as long as\Nwe stay on the Grand Line. This is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.71,0:02:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are but cogs in the gears of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and though they've managed to escape\Nus today, they cannot outrun destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Burgess?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look guys out there! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's solid white!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're clouds! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't we falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clouds float, boats float, same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp isn't breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone do something mouth-to-mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do mouth-to-mouth on Nami! Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, come on, speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all these clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's an ocean in\Nthe sky. No way! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look, the Log Pose\Nis still pointing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we must still be somewhere in the\Nmiddle of the cumulo regalus cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean we have\Nto travel even higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what the Log Pose says, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear you call me a moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, did ya? An ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.87,0:04:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cloud Ocean Swimming Champ, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't swim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't know\Nanything about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see anything,\Nbut I'm really moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so little resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm just going deeper and deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, he's not coming back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ocean may not have an actual bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what? Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that fool just fall\Nthrough the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just told him not to go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stretch out as far as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am, but I can't see where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave that part to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ojos Fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vente fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now pull him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be that heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! He's back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're trying to eat him! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hungry? Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This air, it's so thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the strangest\Ncreature I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure it's a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That octopus thing was\Nmore like a big balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except balloons don't have teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can there be fish\Nup here in the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it best yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.47,0:07:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's an ocean in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.37,0:07:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's this big snake thing?\NI don't know. A flatfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't flat until Sanji kicked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something in my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not his day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's one of the skyfish\NNolan described in his law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded pretty fantastic at\Nthe time, but now that I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like these creatures have somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,actually evolved to survive\Nup here in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They evolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean they turned off\Nflat and Balloon and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make themselves even lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The buoyancy up here must be several times\Nweaker than in the oceans down below.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they grew scales like feathers\Nand those weird carnivore-like mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried sautéing it. Delicious! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were still examining that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you guys thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never tasted anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know me. I aim to please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, let's eat the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where's this Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, there's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, what's wrong, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see something out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! A ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was there, but then it split!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's a bull with wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's running around in the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking crazy. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What got into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a guy running around out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all? He's mine.\NWho is? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let that guy\Nwalk all over you, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna blow us up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.91,0:09:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh great, now who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss, you may call me the Sky Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck was that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you Could you be any more\Nworthless? That was pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had him outnumbered three to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.87,0:10:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I could barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be because of the thin air. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, almost forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Blue Sea People.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Sea People? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.55,0:10:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said, I am the Sky Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Blue Sea People is what we call\Nthose who live beneath the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming that you've\Ntraveled here from the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.97,0:10:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have reached the White\NSea 7,000 meters in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The White White Sea, where\NI assume you're heading,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is still further up, about 10,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ordinary blue sea people\Ncan't possibly endure it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think I've gotten used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I actually feel much better already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, that's just\Nnot possible. So, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knight, why was that guy running\Naround in the clouds attacking people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt you have many questions, but first\Nwe have matters of business to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Business?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I am a soldier for hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The White Seas can be quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are gorillas lurking about\Nlike the one you've just faced who
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would like nothing more than to\Nturn you into food for the skyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you purchase a five million\Nextol one-whistle, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, that price\Nis quite reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to lower\Nit a single extol more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to earn a living, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what the heck is an Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's this whistle thing or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came here from the summit\Nof High West, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you must have\Npassed an island or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what\Nyou're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying there's another\Nway we could have gotten
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up here where we would have\Npassed an island or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As in there's more than\None sky island? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you traveled by way of...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We rode up on the knock-up stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word, that monstrous current?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, there are still souls in the world\Nbrave enough to make the attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it, so we risked\Nour lives for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could have all been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we just asked around a little more, we\Ncould have found a safer way to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you lose any of your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we all made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can consider\Nyourselves fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had you taken a different route, one or\Ntwo of you would have survived the journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the rest of you would have perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By way of the knock-up stream, either\Neveryone dies or everyone survives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the only two possible outcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not many are willing to accept\Nthat sort of all-or-nothing risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, I see now that you are\Nnavigators of exceptional bravery and skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I hate to take\Nall the credit, but see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When things got scary and these guys were
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all screaming and crying\Nfor their mommies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one who stood up and\Nsaid, Nothing at all! Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:12:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the one whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is yours to use as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should you find yourselves in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have but to blow it and\NI will come to your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said, normally I would charge\Nyou five million extol, but for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please accept this as my gift to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, we still don't know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.49,0:13:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Alto, and this is my\Npartner, Pierre! Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite appearances,\NPierre is no ordinary bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.51,0:13:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago, he ate of a horse-horse\Nfruit and gained its powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is able to transform\Ninto a horse with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Namely...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's... something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May luck be with you, brave warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who finds that bizarre?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, he really didn't\Ntell us anything, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, back to square one, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where are we\Nsupposed to go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's call the old man back and ask him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't blow that whistle\Nto ask for directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be for emergencies only!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if that gorilla guy who\Nattacked us comes back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to get blown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what, for\Nnow, let's just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks more like a waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the boat here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, looks like the way's blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.07,0:14:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those big clouds look like they're\Nfloating on top of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sort of like icebergs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what, they're cloudbergs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's obviously\Nsomething different about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can grab a piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It bounced off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all fluffy and bouncy! It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ought to try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does this work? It's a\Nmystery. Woo-hoo! Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a gigantic marshmallow pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just take a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we obviously can't\Nsail through these clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we'll have to find a way\Nto get around them somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.89,0:16:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys see if you can\Nfly around the ship can take!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come check this out! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit playing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that? A gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up ahead underneath\Nthat waterfall thingy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's a man-made structure\Nin the middle of the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, I'm not sure anything\Nwe'd find up here would surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a left, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's to our left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call the old Aokiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's a gate, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look, that weird cloud we saw\Nreally is some kind of waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming down on top\Nof those cloud birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:16:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, am I reading this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:16:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:16:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a place you go when you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well now that you've\Nmentioned it, maybe we are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ever think about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know that would actually go a long\Nway towards explaining this weird place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares? We're here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever this gate goes, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you get fury at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're making a joke, it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why'd you hit me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's somebody coming out.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.05,0:17:36.17,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,759)\fscx75\fscy90\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\b1\bord1.8\c&H030202&\3c&H030202&\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Inspector Amazon\NHeaven's Gate
Dialogue: 2,0:17:32.05,0:17:36.17,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,759)\fscx75\fscy90\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\b1\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(400,0)}Inspector Amazon\NHeaven's Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's what sky people look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so wrinkly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.63,0:17:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,State your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sightseeing, warmongering, other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes little difference. But if\Nyou wish to proceed, you must first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pay the entrance fee of one billion\Nextol per person that is the law what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what billion they're really big on\Nthese extol things around huh i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even count that high i wonder how\Nmuch that would be in berries it's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got to be a lot i mean a billion\Nanything it sounds expensive a billion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Per person, which makes seven billion\Ntotal. Something's fishy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seven billion just to go through a\Nstupid gate i think the old bag's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to scam us listen about the\Nmoney what if you know we don't have it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may still pass what\Nseriously the choice
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is yours i certainly won't try to stop you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my job description does not require\Nme to actually guard the gate i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,merely here to ask your intentions so\Nthat settles it we want to go to the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sky island but we don't have the money\Nso we can't pay you very well the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seven of you then yeah except we still\Nneed you to tell us how to get there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the white sea's famous express lobster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking us up the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Gate, Inspector Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the almighty God above and\Nhis holy priest, I bear tidings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven illegal entrants are\Nheading into God's land, Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bestow upon them Heaven's Judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bestow upon them Heaven's Judgment.

